WEBVTT

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.321
NEIL deBUCK WEASEL: Mars.
火星

00:00:09.405 --> 00:00:11.031
The Red Planet.
红色的星球

00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:15.578
Cold, dry, inhospitable to life.
寒冷、干燥、荒凉

00:00:15.661 --> 00:00:18.539
But billions and billions of years ago
可数十亿年前…

00:00:18.622 --> 00:00:20.666
Mars looked like this.
火星长成这样

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:25.754
There were lakes, rivers, oceans,
有湖、有河，还有海洋…

00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:28.591
the perfect conditions for life to form.
是最适合生命生长的地方

00:00:28.674 --> 00:00:31.176
So, what happened?
那么，发生了什么事呢？

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.096
Why was life unable to take hold?
为什么不再适宜居住了？

00:00:34.179 --> 00:00:35.180
(trills)

00:00:35.514 --> 00:00:36.515
(screaming)

00:00:37.474 --> 00:00:38.767
(screaming)

00:00:38.851 --> 00:00:40.519
Where did the water go?
水去哪了？

00:00:42.021 --> 00:00:44.773
We may never know.
我们可能永远都不知道答案

00:00:44.857 --> 00:00:46.859
(coughing)

00:00:48.193 --> 00:00:49.194
(sniffing)

